-### Performance-Critical Scenarios
-
-```csharp
-[InlineArray(16)]
-public struct Vector16
-{
-    private float _element0;
-}
-
-public class VectorMath
-{
-    public static float DotProduct(in Vector16 a, in Vector16 b)
